<title>INDIA: India cement demand down in 2nd half-L&amp;T.</title>
<headline>India cement demand down in 2nd half-L&amp;T.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian demand for cement has fallen in the second half of fiscal 1996/97 (April-March), an official of Larsen &amp; Toubro Ltd, a leading cement producer, said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
